/// <summary>
/// Runs the official specification's tests.
/// </summary>
/// <remarks>
/// Data is generated by <c>Tools/RefreshSpecTests</c> from the ratified WASM 3.0 spec suite
/// (the <c>wg-3.0</c> tag). Categories that exercise WASM 3.0 features not yet implemented in the
/// library (see <c>docs/Wasm3Plan.md</c> Part B) are deferred: their failing lines are collected
/// into a <c>skip:</c> list, or the whole category is deferred via <see cref="SpecTestRunner.RunAllSkipped"/>
/// when essentially every command depends on the missing feature. A deferred category ends
/// Inconclusive — the pending-work signal — while unaffected categories stay green.
/// </remarks>
